        a.accept("info.bettacraft.tankmate.ember_tetra", "Ember Tetra (Hyphessobrycon amandae) from the Araguaia basin in Brazil.\nA tiny, glowing orange tetra, peaceful and good with bettas.\nShoal of 6 or more, 22–29 °C, water: sensitive. Counts 0.2 fish in the stocking.\nScatters its eggs (fine plants, spawning mop).\nCatch: aquarium net in jungle water, wandering trader.");
        a.accept("entity.bettacraft.glowlight_tetra", "Glowlight Tetra");
