        a.accept("info.bettacraft.tankmate.harlequin_rasbora", "Harlequin Rasbora (Trigonostigma heteromorpha) from the peat swamps of Malaysia, Sumatra and Borneo.\nCopper body with a black wedge; spawns upside down under broad leaves.\nShoal of 6 or more, 22–28 °C, water: sensitive. Counts 0.45 fish in the stocking.\nScatters its eggs (fine plants, spawning mop).\nCatch: aquarium net in swamps, wandering trader.");
        a.accept("entity.bettacraft.mosquito_rasbora", "Mosquito Rasbora");
