        a.accept("info.bettacraft.tankmate.bristlenose_pleco", "Bristlenose Pleco (Ancistrus sp.) from South American rivers; the aquarium form is bred everywhere.\nThe best algae eater of the tankmates; males grow bristles on the snout. Also albino and super red.\nFine on its own, 21–28 °C, water: hardy. Counts 1.2 fish in the stocking.\nSpawns in a cave, the male guards.\nCatch: aquarium net in jungle water, rivers, wandering trader.");
