        a.accept("info.bettacraft.tankmate.kuhli_loach", "Kuhli Loach (Pangio kuhlii) from the peat swamps of Indonesia and Malaysia.\nAn eel-like banded loach that rests in hiding by day and roams the bottom at night.\nShoal of 5 or more, 24–30 °C, water: sensitive. Counts 0.4 fish in the stocking.\nScatters its eggs (fine plants, spawning mop).\nCatch: aquarium net in swamps, wandering trader.");
        a.accept("entity.bettacraft.clown_loach", "Clown Loach");
