        a.accept("info.bettacraft.tankmate.platy", "Platy (Xiphophorus maculatus) from Mexico and Central America.\nA sturdy, peaceful livebearer in many colours.\nShoal of 3 or more, 20–27 °C, water: hardy. Counts 0.5 fish in the stocking.\nBears live young.\nCatch: aquarium net in rivers, wandering trader.");
