        a.accept("info.bettacraft.tankmate.dwarf_gourami", "Dwarf Gourami (Trichogaster lalius) from plant-rich waters of India and Bangladesh.\nBlue and red striped males with long feelers; a labyrinth fish like the betta - male gouramis and male bettas fight.\nFine on its own, 24–29 °C, water: average. Counts 1 fish in the stocking.\nBuilds a foam nest.\nCatch: aquarium net in swamps, wandering trader.");
